      "name": "Gramin Awas Yojana (Housing Assistance)",
      "description": "Financial assistance of up to ₹1,50,000 to construct brick houses (pucca houses) for low-income rural households.",
      "benefits": "Direct bank transfer in three stages of construction, design consultations, free water connection.",
      "eligibilityCriteria": "Rural resident of the Panchayath, annual income below ₹2,00,000, must not own a pucca house in the state.",
      "department": "Administration",
      "category": "Housing",
      "status": "Active",
      "requiredDocuments": [
